OL,3,GNEWSAEstate's Parkrun scrapped over
OL,4,Aincreased pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular running event which has
OL,7,Fattracted almost 10,000 participants
OL,8,Fsince 2021 has been cancelled.
OL,10,FMarkshall Parkrun had taken place every
OL,11,FSaturday at the estate near Coggeshall
OL,12,Fin Essex, but has not been held since
OL,13,F22 August.
OL,15,FContinued growth of the event had
OL,16,Fresulted in "increased pressures" on
OL,17,Fthe site's infrastructure and
OL,18,Ffacilities, a statement on Parkrun's
OL,19,Fwebsite said.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
